Inflicts [121, 163, 195, 223, 247 (TL1-5; MP 100)] mind damage and cripples the target's higher mental functions, reducing cunning by [14, 19, 23, 26, 29 (TL1-5; MP 100)] and confusing ([32%, 36%, 38%, 40%, 41% (TL1-5; MP 100)] power) the target for [2, 3, 4, 5, 6 (TL1-5)] turns.

The damage, cunning penalty, and confusion power will scale with your Mindpower.
